   ],
   "historyNote": [
    "urinla_girls -> urinal_girls: the Girls cell of DCF item 2.5(a)(iii) 'Total number of urinals available'. The grid is identical in the 2021-22 and 2022-23 forms, headings and rows alike. The Boys cell settles the pair on its own: urinal_boys is spelled correctly in all eight releases and never changes, while only the Girls cell carries 'urinla' from 2018-19 to 2021-22. The 2022-23 release corrects it"
   ],
   "definition": "Does the School have Toilet(s)/Urinal(s)? \u2014 Whether incinerator is available in Girl\u2019s toilet?"
  },
