   ],
   "historyNote": [
    "ict_lab -> ict_lab_yn: DCF item 2.27 'Is ICT Lab available in the school?' is word for word identical in 2021-22 and 2022-23. The question did not move. The Ministry's release description did: it narrows the shared column to 'ICT Lab available in school under Samagra Siksha', a restriction the form does not carry"
   ],
   "definition": "Is ICT Lab available in the school?"
  },
