   "note": [
    "enrolment-item-codes: Before 2022-23 an enrolment row named its category in item_desc ('SC', 'Muslim'). From 2022-23 the name is gone and the row is keyed by two integers instead. item_id is NOT numbered within its group: it runs as one sequence across groups 1 and 2, so 1 to 4 are the social categories and 5 to 10 are the religious minorities. In group 4 the same column numbers 21 disability types from 1 again, and in enrolment_data_2 it is an age. The integer alone does not identify the category; the pair does."
   ]
  },
