   "dct:provenance": [
    "Shared 2022-23 to 2025-26 as bigint, described as \u201cpseudocode Code(Unique Identity No. of school)\u201d"
   ],
   "note": [
    "pseudocode-stability: The release withholds the 11-digit UDISE code and substitutes a pseudocode. Arun C. Mehta warns that the pseudocode is not stable: 'even the pseudo ID is not unique as during the next year's UDISE+ data collection, the school may be allotted another pseudo-Id'.",
    "spelling-of-the-key: UDISE spells the school key `psuedocode` before 2022-23. It spells it `pseudocode` after. A unioned table holds both columns. Each column is null in the other era."
   ]
  },
