   "scopeNote": "1-Dept of Education, 2-Tribal Welfare, 3-Local Body, 4-Govt Aided, 5-Private Unaided (Recognised), 6-Other State Govt, 7-Partially Govt Aided, 8-Unrecognized, 89-Minority Affairs, 90-Social Welfare, 91-Ministry of Labour, 92-KVS, 93-NVS, 94-Sainik, 95-Railway, 96-Central Tibetan, 97-Madrasa Pvt Unaided, 98-Madarsa Unrecognized, 99-Madrasa Aided, 101-Other Central Govt/PSU, 102-Veda School",
